[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="CasChapterSceneVisual" load_steps=24 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_scene_resource.gd" id="1_scene"]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_line_resource.gd" id="2_line"]

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_0"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="堤道的钟有三只，走得各不相同。广场那只快一刻，食堂那只慢半刻，值班屋那只已经停了，但每天上工的人还是习惯先看它一眼。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_1"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="为什么不一起校准？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_2"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="管事"

speaker_name=""

text="广场那只催人早到，食堂那只怕人晚来没饭。值班屋那只……修过两次了，修钟的人不在这边，等他回船再说。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_3"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你听完觉得有趣，又觉得事情不能一直这样。旧记录里许多时间都只写几点，没有写按哪只钟；要是把它们直接排在一起，先后关系可能从一开始就是错的。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_4"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="先查这次接触用的计时，不用因为港里三只钟不同，就把所有记录都打成不可信。我们的舰钟定期对，先拿它作今天的基准。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_5"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="莫里拿一根绳，把三只钟对应的记号系在不同位置，让跑腿的人依次去报。她说以前自己帮人传话，说好五点见，结果两个人各在船上干等，直到互相怀疑是不是故意放鸽子。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_6"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="后来都说自己没错，也确实没错。我那天跑得腿都细了，反倒没人问是不是我说的时候少了几个字。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_7"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="你少说了按哪个钟。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_8"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="还有在哪条桥。我们当时连桥名都没对上。人想吵架的时候，脑子会把自己那份默认值藏得特别好。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_9"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你们没有强行把所有钟一次调成一样。先在广场和食堂贴上两张说明，再通知当班的人何时改、改以后旧约定怎么算。否则有人真的早到了，门却还没开。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_10"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="食堂师傅说她可以改钟，但饭点不改。这个意见可以写进去吗？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_11"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="管事"

speaker_name=""

text="可以。饭点写明，别再拿一只慢钟给人猜。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_12"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你忍不住笑。原来有时候人不是反对一项修正，只是在保护修正后没人提到的那一锅汤。把话拆开，反而不用逼她先承认自己一直看错时间。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_13"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="这条新钟表说明能不能抄一份放到值班记录旁边？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_14"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="可以，注明今天才开始。旧记录仍按旧条件读，不能拿现在的统一时间回头说当时谁迟到。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_15"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="校准工作最后只完成了两只。停着的那只没修好，莫里让人把“停走”写得更大，还挂上一小块布，避免别人一眼看过去继续相信它。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_16"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="maury"

speaker_name=""

text="等修好了再摘。漂亮不漂亮先不说，让人少白跑一趟。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_17"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你在一份旧交接表上终于找出两行看似相反的记录：一行按食堂钟，一行按舰钟，原来并不矛盾。这个发现没有指向更大的阴谋，却确实把两个可能被冤枉的人从你的怀疑里挪了出去。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_18"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="我好像开始明白，为什么你们老让我把当时的条件写上。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_19"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="明白归明白，忙的时候还是会忘。我们也会。所以别只靠你记得，表上留一栏，下一班看得见。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_20"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你把新一栏画好，德雷顿顺手在食堂钟那一行画了一只锅。管事看了说挺好，读不清字的人也认得。到了开饭的时候，大家照样涌进门，只是没有谁再因为等错一刻钟，把晚到的人骂得像犯了罪。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "maury", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

